Ok, updated version:<p><pre><code>    void*
    memmove(void *vdst, void *vsrc, int n)
    {
        char *dst, *src;

        dst = vdst;
        src = vsrc;
        if(vdst > vsrc) {
            dst = vdst + n;
            src = vsrc + n;
            while(n-- > 0)
                *--dst = *--src;
        }
        else if(vdst < vsrc)
            while(n-- > 0)
                *dst++ == *src++;
        return vdst;
    }

</code></pre>
Does this solve the bugs?
